{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgan9L3AkAfk7dqCbBnZq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the proof, but I couldn't check it: `lean Main.lean` fails before it reaches my code, so the proof is untested.\n\n**The proof** (in `Main.lean`):\n```lean\ntheorem length_interleave (xs ys : List α) :\n    (interleave xs ys).length = xs.length + ys.length := by\n  match xs, ys with\n  | [], ys => simp [interleave]\n  | x :: xs, ys =>\n    have ih := length_interleave ys xs\n    simp only [interleave, List.length_cons, ih]\n    omega\ntermination_by xs.length + ys.length\n```\n`interleave` swaps its two arguments on each recursive call, so ordinary induction on `xs` doesn't work. Instead, the proof calls itself on `ys xs` and shows it terminates on `xs.length + ys.length`, the same measure the function uses. In the cons case, the goal becomes `ys.length + xs.length + 1 = xs.length + 1 + ys.length`, and `omega` closes it.\n\n**Why it couldn't be checked:** every run fails at line 1 with:\n```\nerror: object file '...\\leanprover--lean4---v4.35.0\\lib\\lean\\Init.olean' of module Init does not exist\n```\nI tried all four installed toolchains (v4.32.2, v4.33.0-rc1, v4.33.1, v4.35.0) and got the same error each time. None of them has `lib/lean/Init.olean`, only the `.olean.private` and `.olean.server` files. That points to a broken Lean install, perhaps from antivirus or a cleanup tool deleting files, not a problem with the proof.\n\nTo fix it, reinstall a toolchain (for example `elan toolchain uninstall leanprover/lean4:v4.35.0` then `elan toolchain install leanprover/lean4:v4.35.0`) and run `lean Main.lean` again. I can do the reinstall and recheck if you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":9677,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":303},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bf7aa75-7bde-461c-9758-4704835b7cd2","uuid":"713e0206-79b5-4ce3-9889-2bb9f9424124","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:21:36.986Z","request_id":"req_011Cgan9Km3LRGfM4Zaui6yp"}
